No change: the new modules use only what the crate already depends on (mixdog-fsio, mixdog-js, mixdog-office-base, mixdog-xlsx-formula, serde_json,
serde and the crate's own modules); the test uses base64, sha2, tempfile, mixdog-fonts and mixdog-office-base (test-support), all listed already.

